       - Invokes DIVERGENCE_ABORT_HASH_MISMATCH()
       - Verifies process exits with code 42
       - Verifies stderr contains "HASH_MISMATCH" and hash values

Before abort happens, NO PARTIAL RESULTS are returned because:
  1. DivergenceAbort() is [[noreturn]]
  2. Exit happens via std::_Exit(42) - immediate termination
  3. No code executes after DIVERGENCE_ABORT*() macro invocation

